<section id="start" class="bc-section">
  <div class="container stack">
    <p class="eyebrow">Start</p>
    <h2>A schema is the whole setup.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      Install it on its own or inside a FrontierJS app, where the same file also seeds the
      API and the UI.
    </p>
    <div class="cluster" style="gap:.75rem">
      <a class="btn primary raised" href="/start/">Quickstart</a>
      <a class="btn outlined" href="https://github.com/frontierjs/frontierjs/tree/main/packages/litestone">Read the source</a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">
      <code>@frontierjs/litestone</code> on npm, MIT licensed, Bun 1.0 or later. No server to
      run beside your app: the database is one file.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

